<title>The Sahel insurgency: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sahel/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sahel-2026-10-20T22:28:22.620Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 22:28:22 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Islamic State-affiliated militants attacked civilians in Mali's Menaka region, killing dozens of people. Mali's military and allied armed groups are also committing abuses against civilians. The conflict remains concentrated in the Sahel, especially Mali, Niger and Burkina Faso, where fighting has persisted since 2012. The latest massacre adds to a pattern of jihadist attacks on non-combatants. The war caused 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxPNUdPNXc2aUNZTUpKMjRKa0pnN0xvaW9VVHItd0o0NHRGcDF2Nnc4d0Z6QkNCLWx5cEY1YmVtblY2THRja1RXX1dIRWVoSEtHX1VSR3dzb01HQ1VIaTJGMno2NUNKekI5bWZET1pQRm5MeWxqTGF1eS1tU0NFS0JCRERVNkY4OW9BRjVrSHV5a3Njb0tZX0QyWUlaTXppbmNNZktXaTd4TlcyZzBiYU1PbGdncXplaDF6NmxkeEEyeFdEOU5FcW1ZRm53?oc=5&quot;&gt;www.livingstonenterprise.net&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiO0FVX3lxTFBMMXZhOFdEakwxWjlJcDlDdFhiUTdudExWZ0JiOGpCeHV0ZGdManZwOGVoUkM2UmJsVU9j?oc=5&quot;&gt;Howl.link&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Modern Ghana&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxNRlAzMTVwWXpjQ3Z4RzIyck12Y1djMDh6a3QzVVRZOWVWN21JRGJzRVk2ZURQYjk0MVhTWVlmVGtNMnRPdlVZOFV1UGhycHZFa0N1OWxxNmNvVTJ5dVB2TXJ3anRoZ0VJSHMzZXdsWmN2Z0E1enJfUTlsZkVIZ1p6Tm1sLW0tREE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Channels Television&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMickFVX3lxTE1mLUxBcUdvMEdxSEZiRHMxTXhiYW13MVpNcmdDOS05b0dHUjVqalFLZkN1WktYOGRxb0lMRlBzemdhei1qLW10SVd2VGg2Ql8ycG9hdWUxQnVXb29DNVZsck9FSG9QME1nWHJ6SjkzTVZEZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Punch Newspapers&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE9zbm00cWlGWk15TlhiS05PS1pTeG5pcU85aXVqNDBJZllNckd